<title>POLAND: Budimex surges 9.8 pct in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Budimex surges 9.8 pct in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish builder Budimex SA surged 9.8 percent in heavy trade to 33.5 zlotys, reacting to its recent profit-taking fall amid the general bullish outlook on Poland's construction market this year, traders said.</p>
<p>Turnover was a session-high 14.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
